"The same code must appear on both computers:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Other branch: %(branch)s\n"
"Fingerprint: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Does the code match?"
msgstr ""
"Na woběmaj ličakomaj dyrbi samsny kod być:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Druhi hałuz: %(branch)s\n"
"Porstowy wotćišć: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Kryje so kod?"

