msgstr "Tutón protyka nadawki (VTODO) njepodpěruje."

msgid ""
"This choice also determines how names appear on contact cards and under "
"which letter they are filed in the index."
msgstr ""
"Tutón wuběr tež postaja, kak so mjena na kontaktowych kartach pokazuja a pod "
"kotrym pismikom so w indeksu zarjaduja."

msgid "This contact card has no email address."
msgstr "Tuta kontaktowa karta žanu e-mejlowu adresu nima."

msgid "This contact card has no postal address."
msgstr "Tuta kontaktowa karta žanu póstowu adresu nima."

msgid "This device does not support synchronization of the custom tab."
msgstr "Tutón grat synchronizaciju wužiwarjoweho rajtarka njepodpěruje."

msgid "This device identifier is unavailable."
msgstr "Tutón identifikator k dispoziciji njeje."

msgid "This dial request has already been queued."
msgstr "Tute naprašowanje za wolenjom čisła je hižo w čakanskim rynku."

msgid "This end-call request has already been queued."
msgstr "Tute naprašowanje za skónčenjom wołanja je hižo w čakanskim rynku."

msgid "This image format cannot be used."
msgstr "Tutón wobrazowy format njehodźi so wužiwać."

msgid "This is a reminder test."
msgstr "To je test dopominanja."

msgid "This is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "To je jenož w instalowanym nałoženju k dispoziciji."

msgid "This is how the organizer reminds you about an appointment."
msgstr "Tak was organizator na termin dopomina."

msgid ""
"This is how your notes look: <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underlined</u> "
"and <s>struck through</s>."
msgstr ""
"Tak waše notice wupadaja: <b>tučne</b>, <i>kursiwne</i>, <u>podšmórnjene</u> "
"a <s>přešmórnjene</s>."

msgid "This is my own phone"
msgstr "To je mój swójski telefon"

msgid "This is not a Magnolienbaum message."
msgstr "To njeje powěsć Magnolienbaum."

msgid ""
"This is one occurrence of a recurring appointment. Changes apply to all "
"occurrences in this series."
msgstr ""
"To je jedne wustupowanje wospjetowaceho termina. Změny płaća za wšě "
"wustupowanja w tutym rjedźe."

msgid ""
"This is only the encrypted Magnolienbaum fallback for baum-1. It does not "
"synchronize calendars or contacts. Both partners need access to the same "
"Nextcloud storage."
msgstr ""
"To je jenož zaklučowany nuzowy puć Magnolienbaum za baum-1. Njesynchronizuje "
"protyki ani kontakty. Wobaj partneraj trjebataj přistup k samsnemu składowi "
"Nextcloud."

msgid ""
"This leaves time to get something, followed by another reminder on the day "
"itself. For example: “Max Mustermann has a birthday tomorrow” and the next "
"day “Max Mustermann has a birthday today”. Anniversary reminders are shown "
"in the morning."
msgstr ""
"Tak wostanje čas něšto wobstarać a na samsnym dnju sćěhuje dalše "
"dopominanje. Na přikład: „Max Mustermann ma jutře narodniny“ a přichodny "
"dźeń „Max Mustermann ma dźensa narodniny“. Dopominanja na róčnicy so rano "
"pokazuja."

msgid "This message has already been received."
msgstr "Tuta powěsć je hižo dóstata."

msgid "This notebook is still empty."
msgstr "Tutón noticnik je hišće prózdny."

msgid ""
"This one-time import only adds or enriches contacts. It does not synchronize "
"or delete contacts."
msgstr ""
"Tutón jónkróćny import kontakty jenož přidawa abo wudospołnja. Kontakty "
"njesynchronizuje ani njezhaša."

msgid "This person's anniversaries"
msgstr "Róčnicy tuteje wosoby"

msgid "This phone transport is unavailable."
msgstr "Tute wašnje zwjazanja z telefonom k dispoziciji njeje."

msgid ""
"This program is free software: you may redistribute and modify it. It is "
"published in the hope that it will be useful, but without any warranty. The "
"full license text is available at /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3."
msgstr ""
"Tutón program je swobodna software: směće jón dale rozdźěleć a změnić. "
"Wozjewja so w nadźiji, zo budźe wužitny, ale bjez kóždeje garantije. "
"Dospołny licencny tekst je pod /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3."

msgid "This secure session already exists."
msgstr "Tute wěste posedźenje hižo eksistuje."

